    <p>
      <b>Algorithms</b>
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li>INIT clears previous/current samples and schedules sampling.</li>
      <li>OUTPUT emits the interpolated held output. UPDATE samples input at ts.</li>
      <li>ts is clamped to at least 0.001.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>
      <b>Equation or Rule</b>
    </p>
    <p>linear interpolation between sampled values</p>
